  "package_id": "nonnegative-rank-positive-core",
  "formal_scope": "Lean covers the factor-rank minimum, the general defect lower bound, paired-nullspace capacity, directional absorption, tensor compression, the nested-square obstruction and profile threshold, the original mixed-block equality in both orders, and the real-parameter saturation interval for the order-two auxiliary. Uniform neighbourhood formulas and the all-size saturation endpoint retain conventional proofs. The new seed lower bound relies on a cited classical result. Novelty is not certified.",
